WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:06.759
What do you want Rangiora to look and feel
like in 10, 20 or 30 years’ time?

00:00:06.759 --> 00:00:09.490
People love to live here and we’re growing
rapidly.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:14.110
By 2048, more than 30,000 people will call
Rangiora home.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:19.290
We’re now planning for the town’s ongoing
growth and success and we want your ideas.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.750
As new neighbourhoods emerge, we need to think
about:

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.440
Building the right type of housing

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.600
Developing new parks and greenspaces

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.760
Providing areas for shops and community facilities

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:35.860
and tying it all together with great options for driving, walking, cycling and public transport.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:42.700
We also need to make sure the Rangiora Town Centre continues to develop successfully

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.820
and has room to expand.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:49.420
How can we build on our centre to create a
vibrant, attractive place where people enjoy

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.580
living, working and spending their free time?

00:00:53.329 --> 00:00:57.980
Help us shape Rangiora’s future by telling
us what you want to see happen!

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:03.370
Tell us your ideas at waimakariri.govt.nz/Rangiora

